OL,3,GNEWSABlackwall and Silvertown tunnel
OL,4,Afees increased
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers using the Blackwall and
OL,7,FSilvertown tunnels will have to pay
OL,8,Fmore to cross the Thames from today.
OL,10,FCharges will rise by between 3.3% and
OL,11,F5%, depending on the vehicle and time
OL,12,Fof travel.
OL,14,FThe Silvertown Tunnel opened in April
OL,15,F2025, when charges were introduced for
OL,16,Fboth crossings. It meant drivers had to
OL,17,Fpay to use the Blackwall Tunnel for the
OL,18,Ffirst time since it opened in 1897.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
