OL,3,GNEWSABlackwall and Silvertown tunnel
OL,4,Afees increased
OL,5,
OL,6,FTfL said the charges were intended to
OL,7,Fmanage traffic across the tunnels,
OL,8,Frepay the cost of building Silvertown
OL,9,Fand help fund the operation and
OL,10,Fmaintenance of both crossings.
